WEBVTT

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:14.570
It's a full-dive RPG that
pursues the ultimate in realism.

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:16.080
If it's lame, I'm returning it!

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:17.790
No! He's dead!

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:19.040
Oh, shit! Oh, shit! Oh, shit!

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:19.870
What the hell?

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:21.670
"Best Friend Killer"!

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:24.040
It's game over right off the bat!

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:21.960
{=2}Best Friend Killer

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:21.960
{=1}Amicide

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:22.000
{=2}Best Friend Killer

