00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:24.320
Whatever. I don't care.
Just stop playing games late at night.

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:27.320
Or cover your eyes, nose, and mouth first!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.490
That'd kill me!

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:36.290
What is everyone's problem?

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.540
I'll log in, so make sure to join me!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.540
Even if it kills you!

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:42.710
It's just a game.

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:50.430
That hurts!

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:52.810
I start in exactly the same condition?

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:56.770
Would it kill them to
let me recover a little?

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.900
I had silver coins in my right pocket.

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:02.320
So then they probably also gave me...

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:06.070
Yes! I knew it!

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:07.820
Barf!

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:10.450
Realistic medicinal herbs, too?

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:14.120
Huh?

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:16.660
In a normal full-dive game...

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:22.170
...it would activate just like that.

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:23.550
Hey! Come on!

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:25.340
Do it. Say something.

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:27.630
What? What's the deal? Still no?

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:30.050
Take that! Well? What about this?

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:32.100
It's looking a little wilted.

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:35.020
What? Is this like real life, too?

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:40.230
How do you use herbs?
Stick 'em on? Boil and drink?

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:41.980
I have no idea!

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:43.520
And the blood's not stopping!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.070
What the hell?

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:53.370
What's this? I haven't
seen this NPC before.

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:55.790
Hey, I'm not an NPC!

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:57.830
Wait. "NPC"?

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:01.460
If he's using meta
terminology, could he be...

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:02.920
Ginji?

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:06.590
Huh? How do you know my name?

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:08.420
Oh, I was right!

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:11.550
I'm a player character!

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:13.550
And also I've been looking for you!

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:15.390
I'm kinda screwed.

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:18.060
To be playing a dead game
like this at your age,

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:20.230
I can believe your life is screwed.

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:23.480
I'm talking about the game, not my life!

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.900
Anyway, lemme see that.

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:27.320
Huh?

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:30.110
This takes me back ten years.

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:33.490
Ow! Will this heal immediately now?

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:35.580
No, it'll hurt for two or three days.

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:40.040
What?! This herb's no
different from normal healing!

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:44.460
But thank you for your help.

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:47.960
Don't sweat it. We're dead game pals.

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:50.130
You said you were looking for me?

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:53.140
Follow me. Let's go somewhere to talk.

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:59.270
This is a casino?

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:05.230
Here. Drink up!

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:09.690
A-Alcohol? I'm underage...

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:13.450
It tastes like cola. It's not booze.

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:16.830
R-Really?

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:18.410
Yum!

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.290
Ah, that was refreshing.

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:26.500
Wait, how is he drunk
on this? He's strange.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:28.840
So what do you need?

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:30.460
Oh, right!

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:35.180
Well, um, I heard that you
you-know'ed your best friend,

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:38.760
and actually, I did, too--on accident!

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:40.430
Oh, you, too?

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:42.940
I really didn't mean to--

00:18:42.940 --> 00:18:45.350
Right. Of course.

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:45.350
No, really--

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:48.320
Hey, I'm clearly talking to someone here.

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:49.190
Huh?

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:56.200
Look, I've told you. I don't
know the answer! I never have!

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:59.700
Huh? What?

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.620
This is scary.

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:07.880
Sorry. They've appeared for ten years
now. And always at random times.

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:09.500
Wh-What does?

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.840
You'll see soon enough.

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:14.340
Very soon.

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:21.140
What was it again? You asked
about how I killed Enrique?

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:25.980
"Enrique"? Is that your best friend?
Mine was named Martin.

00:19:25.980 --> 00:19:29.440
The best friend's name
is different for everyone.

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:31.280
I see...

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:34.360
So why did you kill your best friend NPC?

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.740
It was a youthful
indiscretion, you could say.

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:41.490
Haven't you ever wanted to try shooting
the townsfolk in a gun game? Same thing.

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:43.410
I've never wanted to or done that.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:47.370
I got annoyed at Enrique's
best friend routine,

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.540
so I just gave his neck a little squeeze.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:52.590
It was that easy?

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:55.800
I did judo. Sleeper moves made it a cinch.

00:19:55.800 --> 00:20:01.260
The childhood friend wouldn't stop
screaming, so I strangled her, too.

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:04.520
Who does that in a realistic VR game?

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:09.020
You mean you did judo in real life, right?
Weren't you weak in the game?

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:12.690
KQ stats reflect your
real-life physical ability.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:13.820
Seriously?

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:16.950
Then to beat the game,
you need to work out?

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:20.320
The game pursues the
ultimate in realism, so yeah.

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:24.240
If you don't have martial arts
experience or a crafty mind,

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:28.120
you can't even get out of this town.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:30.580
But then no one could win the--

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:32.920
Someone did win.

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:37.930
Someone fully cleared
this crazy-hard game.

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:43.890
I only saw him once, but even as
forgetful as I am, I could never forget.

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:47.680
He was sharp, and he was also strong.

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:54.150
He looked kinda like a normal student,
but he had an aura about him.

00:20:54.150 --> 00:21:00.450
Apparently he got out of Ted in
no time and easily cleared the game.

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:02.280
His name was Kamui.

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:09.500
His title was "The Eternally Invincible:
The Never-Bested Adventurer."

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:11.330
S-So cool!

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.130
Nothing like "Best Friend Killer!"

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:17.800
Mine's just "Not Human: Heartless."

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:20.880
Even though I've lived a pretty
normal life these last 45 years.

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:23.890
Though I did skip out on
my convenience store job.

00:21:23.890 --> 00:21:27.020
Yeah, that's kinda heartless.

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:30.390
So now what do I do?

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:32.480
Want me to help you?

00:21:32.480 --> 00:21:35.820
What? Are you saying you'll join my party?

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:37.990
I'm too old for that now.

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:41.700
Like I could do kid stuff
like games. Don't be silly.

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:44.530
We're in a game right now!

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:47.410
Besides, I have gout.

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.750
And my body doesn't
move the way it used to.

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:53.670
Oh. Then what help--

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:56.670
Well, this kind of help.

00:21:59.300 --> 00:22:04.340
Hey! The killer is right here!

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:08.970
Call the City Guard!

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:11.730
Th-This asshole!

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:14.940
He really is heartless!

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:49.280
Episode 3: Adult Event Time.
